  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Roughly chop capsicum. Slice carrot into half-moons. Slice red onion into wedges.\n• Place chopped veggies on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839319fd9848b9dac058adc/step-13a01100.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic. Trim green beans and roughly chop.\n• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook garlic and tomato paste until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add beans, the water, garlic seasoning, the stock powder and risoni, stirring to combine. Bring to the boil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839319fd9848b9dac058adc/step-f638b010.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium and cook, stirring, until ‘al dente’, 7-8 mins. Remove from heat.\n• Stir roasted veggies and the butter through risoni. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839319fd9848b9dac058adc/step-af691320.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide veggie-loaded risoni between bowls.\n• Top with Parmesan cheese.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839319fd9848b9dac058adc/step-c3eaad30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
